# Cloudflare Pages — _redirects file
#
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# ── SPA Fallback ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All unmatched routes return index.html with HTTP 200 (not 301/302).
# This allows React Router to handle client-side navigation.
# Without this, direct URL access (e.g. /about) returns a 404 from Cloudflare.
#
# IMPORTANT: This must be the LAST rule in the file.
# More specific redirects (e.g., www → apex) go ABOVE this line.

# ── www → apex redirect ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
https://www.alaman.site/* https://alaman.site/:splat 301

# ── SPA fallback (must be last) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
/*  /index.html  200
